OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate rape of girl,
OL,4,A14, in wooded area
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have set up a cordon in a wooded
OL,7,Farea after a 14-year-old girl reported
OL,8,Fbeing raped by a man she did not know.
OL,10,FThe girl reported the attack happened
OL,11,Fin an area of trees off the Wide Lane
OL,12,Froundabout, near Mansbridge Road in
OL,13,FSouthampton, shortly before 15:10 BST
OL,14,Fon Sunday. She is being supported by
OL,15,Fspecialist officers.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
