OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate rape of girl,
OL,4,A14, in wooded area
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire police said the man, aged in
OL,7,Fhis 30s or 40s was reported to be tall,
OL,8,Fskinny, with slicked back blonde,
OL,9,Fgreasy "curtain-style" hair with
OL,10,Finch-long beard hair, pale/sandy skin
OL,11,Fand an arm tattoo that looks like
OL,12,Fwriting.
OL,14,FThe force is urging anyone who
OL,15,Frecognises the description or has CCTV,
OL,16,Fdoorbell or dashcam footage from the
OL,17,Farea at the time to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
